{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# System Architecture\n**ESP32-S3 E-Ink E-Reader v0.2.0**\nLILYGO T5 4.7\" S3 · 960×540 · 16-grey",
      "x": 0, "y": -400, "width": 500, "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "hw",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hardware (ESP32-S3)\n- LilyGo-EPD47 display driver\n- SPI microSD (GPIO 11/15/16/42)\n- I2S INMP441 mic (GPIO 39/45/48)\n- ADC2 battery (GPIO 14)\n- Wi-Fi + BLE\n- 16MB flash · 8MB PSRAM (OPI)",
      "x": -500, "y": 600, "width": 320, "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "platform",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Platform Services\n- **DisplayManager** — EPD rendering, fonts\n- **BookStorage** — SD + LittleFS abstraction\n- **WebPortal** — ESPAsyncWebServer (book upload)\n- **UsbMassStorage** — TinyUSB MSC (optional)\n- **TextReader** — pagination + rendering",
      "x": -500, "y": 250, "width": 320, "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "core",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Core Logic (src/core/) — HAL-free\nHeader-only · namespace core · No heap\n\n**Calendar:** IcsParser · CalendarDate · CalendarEvent · SyncSchedule\n**Weather:** OpenMeteo\n**QR:** Emvco · QrPayload\n**Todo:** TodoModel\n**Voice:** VoiceModel\n**Agenda:** AgendaMerge\n**Reader:** Paginator · PageLayout · TextTransform · Format\n**System:** BatteryMath · ButtonClassify · BookmarkStore · PathValidation · RefsIndex · GithubModel",
      "x": -150, "y": 200, "width": 500, "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "framework",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## App Framework (src/app/)\n- **App** — abstract base (onEnter/onExit/onButton/onLoop)\n- **AppManager** — lifecycle, button decode, sleep/wake\n- **SystemContext** — DI container (display, storage, wifi)\n- **AppRegistry** — one-line-per-app registration\n- **WifiSession** — RAII WiFi guard, portal-guard, NTP",
      "x": -150, "y": -50, "width": 500, "height": 200,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "reader",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Features/Reader.md",
      "x": -600, "y": -250, "width": 200, "height": 100
    },
