    {
      "id": "tests",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Native Tests (test/)\n122+ passing · Unity framework\n\nHardware-free · Deterministic · Host-compiled\nTests include src/core/*.h directly\n\n`pio test -e native`",
      "x": 400, "y": 250, "width": 300, "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "secrets",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Secrets (src/secrets.h)\n🔒 Git-ignored — never commit\n\nWiFi creds · ICS URLs · Weather coords\nQR payloads · GitHub PAT · Voice backend\n\nFirmware builds without it (graceful empty state)",
      "x": 400, "y": 500, "width": 300, "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Button Navigation\n**Single-button (GPIO 21):**\n- Tap (≤350ms) → next page\n- Medium hold (350-750ms) → prev page\n- Long hold (≥750ms) → menu\n\n**Two-button (planned):**\n- Button A (GPIO 9) → forward\n- Button B (GPIO 46) → back/home",
      "x": -500, "y": -50, "width": 300, "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
